十三岁的年龄，哪来那么深沉的心机，更何况就算是蓄谋已久的，难道自己还怕她一个没有丝毫灵力的废物？视线不经意之间划过她的锁骨，眸色更深了，于是加快了脚步，向破庙走去，真是天助他也，前些日子没能做成的事也许今天能成就好事。走到破庙中，将少女放在干草堆上，刚将手伸向她的腰带，就被扑上来的少女阻止了。“冷…我冷…”将她从怀中拽出来，宋如风控制住她不停挥舞的双手，认命的生火了。的确，这破庙四处漏风，要是真将她冻坏，自己不能尽兴，那就得不偿失了。拿出打火石，将四处散乱的甘草和木柴拢到一起，火光映衬着他yin笑的脸，将往日翩翩佳公子的形象破坏殆尽。战轻狂微睁开眼，看着背对着自己的人，很快就有了主意。摸上他的背，不时的拿小脸蹭蹭，嘴里还是喊着冷。宋如风拨弄柴火的手一顿，刚升起来的警惕性就被她三两下蹭没了。“小妖精，还冷是吗？不急，长夜漫漫，我保证你一会就暖起来了，还会大汗淋漓。”真想不到充满暗示的话是从他嘴里说出，这要是让湘城的百姓看到，怕是会大跌眼镜吧！战轻狂很好的隐藏了自己的杀气，沿着他的后背，小手渐渐伸向他的脖子。而宋如风正被那柔弱无骨的小手摸得心痒痒，有些飘飘欲仙呢！说时迟那时快，战轻狂闪电般的出手，左手掐住他的脖子，右手扣住下颚，狠狠一用力，只听“咔嚓”一声，宋如风如同一滩烂泥一样摔倒在地，溅起一地的尘土，他或许没想到，自己的命就这样交代在一个他从没有放在眼里的废物手上。战轻狂鄙视的看看地上的尸体，淡淡出声：“不要轻易将后背交给敌人，不知道吗？”手起刀落，处理好现场，战轻狂踏月离去。谁也没想到名声大震的佳公子就这样凄凉的死在破庙中，并且“死无全尸。”还有最后一个，韩志远。这个人是四人帮中最弱小的存在，从来都是别人说什么就是什么，遇到大事，没有主见，胆小如鼠，只知道阿谀奉承，碰见厉害的人，连声都不敢支，可是遇到比他还弱的，就是另一幅嘴脸。比如说曾经的南宫轻狂，韩志远一向的踩低怕高，见不得别人比他好，那些阴损的主意都是他提出来的，丫的，整个就是一个名副其实的贱人！相信三个人的死亡已经造成他的恐慌了吧，呵呵，要的就是这样的效果，让他在恐慌之中一点点的焦躁，不安，担惊受怕，自己将自己逼疯。“哎呦，你知道吗？今儿早上，宋家找到了佳公子的尸首了…”“是呢，我亲眼看见了…”“听说啊，和之前的两起事件是一样的手法，肯定是一个人做的…”“据说是一个修武强者下的手，现场一点灵力打斗的痕迹都没有，都是一下毙命呢！”“可不是吗？城主大人已经发出a级任务，重金悬赏了，也不知道他们到底是得罪了什么人，南宫家的和冯家的还有情可原，可是这佳公子怎么也惨遭毒手了呢？”“……”就在街边百姓七嘴八舌的同时，高大的宅院中，一个男子正藏在房间中，不停的颤抖，疑神疑鬼，神经兮兮的。看着富丽堂皇的宅院，战轻狂脑中飞快的旋转，想必多起事件已经引起韩志远的警觉，该怎么打入敌人内部呢？正当她绞尽脑汁时，身边两个韩府的下人引起她的注意力。“该死的，手气真背，这下好了，钱都输光了。”“哎呀，是啊，钱都没了，总管还让买丫头呢，回去怎么交代啊？”“你问我，我问谁啊？”“大家都有份，你跟我喊什么？”买丫头？正好，真是想打瞌睡就送枕头呢！于是，两个将银子输光的下人一分钱都没用，就“买”了个小丫头回去，只是这丫头丑了点，脸上一大块红色的胎记，还是个哑巴。两个下人自然是少不了挨骂，本来是让他们买个能伺候人，上的了台面的人，可谁知道带回来的是这么个丑丫头，只好让她去厨房打杂了。最近，韩府的下人都人心惶惶的，就怕犯了什么错被责罚。想知道为什么？是小少爷出事了，以前整日的出门游玩，不见人影，可是现在根本就连房门都不出，饭菜都是送进去的，脾气暴躁，总打骂下人不说，还总是说遇见鬼了，半夜还能听见他房间里传来吼叫，说什么不要杀他，不要杀他。家主大人气不过说了他几次，小少爷却根本没有听进去，反而变本加厉。老太君心疼孙子，千哄万哄的答应找了好几个大灵师保护他，这才消停下来。虽然不吵不闹了，可还是整日的不出房门。听到这里，战轻狂冷冷一笑，害怕了？更残忍的还在后头呢！这一天，经商在外的大少爷回到了家中，向家主汇报完情况之后，准备回到自己的房间休息一下，没想到在花园中听到了这样的对话。“大少爷总算是回来了，要是再不回来，这家里都快没有他的位置了。”“是呢，府里谁不知道家主老来得子喜爱小少爷，老太君更是宠的没边呢！”“难不成，这府里要变天？”“嘘，我悄悄和你说啊，这也是我偷听的，你可别和别人说啊！”“好好，你快说，快说…”“听说啊，家主大人总是把大少爷派出去，就是为了瓦解他的势力，好扶植小少爷呢！”“真的吗？”“那当然了，家主大人最心疼的就是小少爷了，还找了很多强者保护小少爷呢！韩府下一代家主还不一定是谁呢！”“是呢，我可得好好打点一下，要是讨得小少爷开心，以后的好处可是不少呢…”看到韩大少气愤的甩袖而走，花园中的声音也顿时消失了，仔细一看，哪是两个丫鬟在说悄悄话，只有一个丑丫头拍拍脚下的土，转身回到了厨房。也不知道大少爷究竟看到了什么，又和家主说了什么，反正今天晚上，家主大人让管家将小少爷“请”出了房门，叫到书房去训话。不一会儿，里边就传来争吵的声音，小少爷气愤的摔门离去，匆忙之中连那几个强者都没带在身边。躲在花园假山里的战轻狂正等着迷途的小羔羊怎么样掉下陷阱呢，她心里不断的喊着：来啰，快来啰！只差没挥着小手绢了。当气愤的怒骂声和脚步声传来，战轻狂勾唇一笑，从假山上一跃而下，将韩志远扑到，膝盖顶在他的腰椎上，利落的手法，扭断了他的脖子，看着他恐惧的脸，只觉得好笑。将他“分尸”之后，看着乱成一团的韩府，她无声的笑了，总算是对得起南宫轻狂了。趁着天黑，人影闪过，无人问津的丑丫头就这样离开了韩府。走在湘城郊外的小路上，战轻狂看了一眼这曾经生活了十年的地方，挥手说了声再见，潇洒的离去了。却不知道整个湘城因为她闹得人人自危，城主大怒，卫兵整日的巡逻，几个家族哭喊声震天…此时的战轻狂来到了林中的湖边，挑了一个芳草鲜美，满是鲜花的地方，挖了一个坑，将第一天穿的破烂的衣服埋了进去，立了一个衣冠冢，刻的墓碑上写着：南宫轻狂之墓。“南宫轻狂，答应你的事，我已经做到了，当初害死你的人，都被我亲手送进地狱了，欺负你的人得到了应有的下场，请你安息吧！这里是你生前最喜欢的地方，我将你葬在这里，你就能永远自由了，蓝天白云，清澈的湖水，无数鲜花的陪伴，想必也是你心中所愿吧！从此以后天地之间再也没有南宫轻狂了，只有我战轻狂，古武世家的掌舵人。占据了你的身体，我很抱歉，却也感谢你，没有你，我不会有重生的机会。我会踏上强者之路，成为人人睥睨的存在，人挡杀人，佛挡杀佛，造就一代神话！愿你冥冥之中能见证那一刻的到来。”随着少女霸气的话语，衣衫猎猎作响，无风自动，就在这片美丽的林子里，一缕芳魂黯然消逝，而灵隐大陆却有一颗新星冉冉升起！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/hundanmohouxiaozhangniangqing/5.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "Chapter 5 All die in the same way (2) There is a ruined temple on the mountain peak closest to Xiangcheng, and this mountain peak is the only way in and out of Xiangcheng. Therefore, Zhan Qingkuang has spent the past few days in this ruined temple. Standing on the top of the mountain, he can see people coming and going on both sides of the road. On this day, the sun was almost setting. I solved the problem of dinner and practiced my skills as usual. However, at a casual glance, I saw a man dressed in white, riding a maroon horse galloping towards me. Coming! Zhan Qingkuang tore his clothes, rubbed them on the ground, and pulled off one of his sleeves, revealing his white and tender arms. Then, he \"passed out\" on the road in an embarrassed state. The clatter of horse hooves came from far to near, and finally stopped beside me. The horse was running happily when it was suddenly reined in and stopped, neighing and pawing anxiously on the ground. \"Hot...hot...\" Song Rufeng looked around quietly, why was she here? Deliberate or coincidence? Just as he was thinking hard, he was interrupted by the girl's moans. He saw her face was pale, her brows were furrowed, and she looked very painful. Her clothes were ragged, exposing a large area of ​​skin. Seeing this, his eyes flashed. As soon as she squatted down, she grabbed her arm. During the struggle, the collar slipped down to her shoulder blades. The girl was as weak as a kitten that had been beaten by a storm, looking forward to someone taking it home and caring for it. \"Cold...I'm cold, hug...\" She snuggled her body into his arms, and Zhan Qingkuang inadvertently blew her sweet breath on his neck. She hid all her expressions until she was picked up by him. Seeing the girl in his arms trembling, Song Rufeng felt that he was overthinking. How could he have such deep thoughts at the age of thirteen? What's more, even if he had planned it for a long time, was he still afraid of her, a waste without any spiritual power? His gaze inadvertently crossed her collarbone, and his eyes darkened, so he quickened his pace and walked towards the ruined temple. God was really helping him. Maybe he could do something good today that he couldn't do a few days ago. He walked to the ruined temple and placed the girl on a pile of hay. As soon as he reached for her belt, he was stopped by the girl who rushed forward. \"Cold...I'm cold...\" Pulling her out of his arms, Song Rufeng controlled her waving hands and resigned to his fate. Indeed, this ruined temple was leaking air from all directions. If she really froze and couldn't enjoy herself to the fullest, it would be more of a loss than a gain. He took out flint and steel and gathered the scattered licorice and firewood together. The firelight reflected his smiling face, completely destroying his former image of a handsome young man. Zhan Qingkuang opened his eyes slightly, looked at the person with his back turned, and quickly came up with an idea. I touched his back and rubbed his face from time to time, still shouting that it was cold. Song Rufeng fiddled with the firewood for a moment, and the vigilance she had just raised was wiped out by her. \"Little goblin, it's still cold, isn't it? Don't worry, it's a long night, I guarantee you'll warm up in a while and you'll be sweating profusely.\" I really didn't expect such suggestive words to come out of his mouth. If the people of Xiangcheng saw this, I'm afraid they would be shocked! Zhan Qingkuang hid his murderous intent very well. Along his back, his small hands gradually stretched towards his neck. And Song Rufeng was being touched by those weak and boneless hands, feeling a little ecstatic! Soon enough, Zhan Qingkuang took action like lightning, strangled his neck with his left hand, and clasped his chin with his right hand. With a strong force, there was a \"click\", and Song Rufeng fell to the ground like a puddle of mud, splashing dust all over the ground. He may not have expected that his life would be handed over to a useless hand that he never paid attention to. Zhan Qingkuang looked at the corpse on the ground with disdain and said faintly: \"Don't hand your back to the enemy easily, don't you know?\" He raised the knife in his hand, took care of the scene, and left on the moon. No one expected that the famous Mr. Jia would die miserably in the ruined temple, and \"he died without a complete body.\" There was also the last one, Han Zhiyuan. This person is the weakest person in the Gang of Four. He always does what others say. When it comes to big things, he has no opinion and is as timid as a mouse. He only knows how to flatter people. He doesn't even dare to say anything when he meets powerful people. But when he meets someone weaker than him, he has a different face. For example, Nangong was frivolous in the past, and Han Zhiyuan had always been shy and afraid of heights. He didn't want others to be better than him. He was the one who came up with all those sinister ideas. Damn it, he was a veritable bitch! I believe that the deaths of three people have caused him to panic. Haha, the desired effect is to make him a little bit restless, uneasy, and scared in the panic, driving himself crazy. \"Oh, did you know? This morning, the Song family found the body of Mr. Jia...\" \"Yes, I saw it with my own eyes...\" \"I heard that it was the same method as the two previous incidents. It must have been done by one person...\" \"It is said that it was done by a strong martial artist. There was no trace of spiritual fighting at the scene. They were all killed in one shot!\" \"Isn't it true? City Lord Your Excellency has issued an A-level mission with a huge reward. I don’t know who they have offended. The Nangong family and the Feng family still have some extenuating feelings, but how come this good young master was brutally murdered? \"\"...\" While the people on the street were talking, a man was hiding in the room in the tall house, trembling, suspicious, and nervous. Looking at the magnificent mansion, Zhan Qingkuang's mind was spinning rapidly. Many incidents must have aroused Han Zhiyuan's vigilance. How to break into the enemy's interior? While she was racking her brains, two servants from the Han family next to her caught her attention. \"Damn, I'm really unlucky. Now it's over, all the money is lost.\" \"Oh, yes, the money is gone, and the manager still asked me to buy a girl. How will I explain it when I go back?\" \"Ask me, who should I ask?\" \"Everyone has a share, what are you shouting to me?\" Buy a girl? Just right. If you really want to take a nap, give me a pillow.", "title_en": "Chapter 5"}